docs {
  Updates the faculty tab for a course.
  Stored as { list: [...] } in metadata.tabData.faculty.

  Public endpoint (GET /public/.../tabs/faculty) strips the { list } wrapper
  and returns the array directly:
    { "success": true, "data": [...] }

  Required env vars:
    courseId   — set by list-courses.bru or create-course.bru
    staffToken — set by login.bru
}
